#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Virtaal tutorial. You can do the first translation by typing "
"just the translation for \"Welcome\". Then press Enter."
msgstr ""
"Ongi etorri Virtaal-en tutorialera. Lehenengo itzulpena egiteko idatzi "
"\"Welcome\" hitzaren itzulpena. Gero sakatu Enter."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"Translate this slightly longer message. If a spell checker is available, "
"spelling mistakes are indicated similarly to word processors. Make sure the "
"correct language is selected in the bottom right of the window."
msgstr ""
"Itzuli pixka bat luzeagoa den mezu hau. Ortografia-egiaztatzailea "
"erabilgarri badago, ortografia-akatsak testu-prozesadoreetan bezala agertuko "
"dira. Ziurtatu hizkuntza egokia hautatuta dagoela leihoaren behean eskuineko "
"aldean."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This tutorial will show you some of the things you might want to pay "
"attention to while translating software programs. It will help you to avoid "
"some problems and produce translations of a higher quality."
msgstr ""
"Software-programen itzulpenak egin ahala arreta jarri beharreko zenbait "
"gauza erakutsiko dizkizu tutorial honek. Zenbait arazo ekidin eta kalitate "
"handiagoko itzulpenak burutzen lagunduko dizu."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"Some of the advice will only be relevant to some languages. For example, if "
"your language does not use the Latin alphabet, some of the advice might not "
"be relevant to translation in your language. For many languages there are "
"established translation rules."
msgstr ""
"Zenbait aholku hizkuntza batzuei bakarrik dagokie. Adibidez, zure hizkuntzak "
"ez badu alfabeto latina erabiltzen, aholku batzuk ez dira aproposak izango "
"zure itzulpenetarako. Hizkuntza askotarako itzulpen-arau sendoak daude."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"The correct use of capital letters are important in many languages. "
"Translate this message with careful attention to write \"Virtaal\" with a "
"capital letter."
msgstr ""
"Hizkuntza askotan letra larrien erabilera garrantzitsua da. Itzuli mezu hau "
"arretaz \"Virtaal\" letra larriekin idazteko."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"In this message the English uses a capital letter for almost every word. "
"Almost no other language uses this style. Unless your language definitely "
"needs to follow the English style (also called Title Case), translate this "
"by following the normal capitalisation rules for your language. If your "
"language does not use capital letters, simply translate it normally."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honetan ingelesak letra larria erabiltzen du ia hitz guztietarako. Ez "
"dago estilo hau erabiltzen duen beste hizkuntzarik ia. Ez bada zure "
"hizkuntzak ingelesaren estilo hau jarraitzeko beharra duela (Title Case "
"gisara ere ezagutzen da), itzuli zure hizkuntzaren letra larri eta xeheen "
"arauak jarraituz. Zure hizkuntzak ez baditu letra larriak erabiltzen, itzul "
"ezazu normal."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"If you translated the previous message you should see a window with that "
"translation and a percentage indicating how similar the source strings "
"(English) are. It is Virtaal's translation memory at work. Press Ctrl+1 to "
"copy the suggested translation to the current translation. Remember to "
"always review suggestions before you use them."
msgstr ""
"Aurreko mezua itzuli baduzu, itzulpena duen leihotxo bat ikusiko duzu, "
"iturburu-katearekiko (ingelesa) antzekotasuna adierazten duen ehunekoarekin. "
"Virtaal-en itzulpen-memoria da hau. Sakatu Ktrl+1 gomendatutako itzulpena "
"uneko itzulpenera kopiatzeko. Gomendioak erabili aurretik, gogoratu hauek "
"berrikusteaz."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This is a simple message that starts with a capital letter in English. If "
"your language uses capital letters, you almost definitely want to start your "
"translation with a capital letter as well."
msgstr ""
"Ingelesez letra larriz hasten den mezu sinple bat da hau. Zure hizkuntzak "
"letra larriak erabiltzen baditu, ziurrenik letra larriz hasi nahiko duzu "
"zure itzulpena ere."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This is a simple message that starts with a lower case letter in English. If "
"your language uses capital letters, you almost definitely want to start your "
"translation with a lower case letter as well."
msgstr ""
"Ingelesez letra xehez hasten den mezu sinple bat da hau. Zure hizkuntzak "
"letra larriak erabiltzen baditu, ziurrenik letra larriz hasi nahiko duzu "
"zure itzulpena ere."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message is a question. Make sure that you use the correct question mark "
"in your translation as well."
msgstr ""
"Mezu hau galdera bat da. Ziurtatu itzulpenean ere galdera-ikur egokia "
"erabiltzen duzula."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message is a label as part of a form. Note how it ends with a colon (:)."
msgstr ""
"Mezu hau inprimaki bateko mezua da. Konturatu nola bi punturekin (:) "
"amaitzen den."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"If the source will remain mostly or completely unchanged it is convenient to "
"copy the entire source string with Ctrl+Shift+V. Here is almost nothing to "
"translate, so just press Ctrl+Shift+V and make corrections if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Iturburua nagusiki edo osorik aldatu gabe geratuko bada, komenigarria da "
"iturburu-kate osoa Ktrl+Shift+V konbinazioarekin kopiatzea. Hemen ia ez dago "
"itzuli beharrekorik, beraz sakatu Ktrl+Shift+V eta egin zuzenketak behar "
"ahala."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
#| msgid ""
#| "Placeables are special parts of the text that can be automatically "
#| "highlighted and easily inserted into the translation."
msgid ""
"Placeables are special parts of the text, like the © symbol, that can be "
"automatically highlighted and easily inserted into the translation. Select "
"the © with Alt+Right and transfer it to the target with Alt+Down."
msgstr ""
"Elementu bereziak testuaren zati ezohikoak dira, adibidez © sinboloa, eta "
"automatikoki nabarmen daitezke, itzulpenean modu errazean txertatzeko. "
"Hautatu © Alt+Eskuina konbinazioarekin eta txertatu testu-eremuan Alt+Behera "
"erabiliz."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"Recognised placeables include special symbols, numbers, variable "
"placeholders, acronyms and many more. Move to each one with Alt+Right and "
"transfer it down with Alt+Down."
msgstr ""
"Antzemandako elementu bereziek sinboloak, zenbakiak, aldagaien leku-markak, "
"akronimoak eta gehiago izan ditzakete. Aldatu lekuz hauen artean Alt+Eskuina "
"konbinazioarekin eta txertatu behean Alt+Behera erabiliz."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message ends with ... to indicate that clicking on this text will cause "
"a dialogue to appear instead of just performing an action. Be sure to end "
"your message with ... as well."
msgstr ""
"Mezu hau etenpuntuekin (…) amaitzen da eta adierazten du testu honetan klik "
"eginda elkarrizketa-koadro bat agertuko dela ekintza bat burutu beharrean. "
"Ziurtatu zure mezua ere etenpuntuekin (…) amaitzen dela."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message ends with a special character that looks like three dots. "
"Select the special character with Alt+Right and copy it to your translation "
"with Alt+Down. Don't just type three dot characters."
msgstr ""
"Mezu hau hiru punturen antza duen karaktere berezi batekin amaitzen da. "
"Hautatu karaktere berezia Alt+Eskuina konbinazioarekin eta kopia ezazu "
"itzulpenean Alt+Behera erabilita. Ez daukazu hiru puntuen karakterea idatzi "
"beharrik."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message has two sentences. Translate them and make sure you start each "
"with a capital letter if your language uses them, and end each sentence "
"properly."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek bi esaldi ditu. Itzul itzazu eta ziurtatu bakoitza letra "
"larriekin hasten dela, zure hizkuntzak hauek erabiltzen baditu, eta amaitu "
"esaldi bakoitza behar bezala."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message marks the word \"now\" as important with bold tags. These tags "
"can be transferred from the source with Alt+Right and Alt+Down. Leave the "
"<b> and </b> in the translation around the part that corresponds to \"now\". "
"Read more about XML markup here: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XML"
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek \"now\" hitza garrantzitsu gisa markatzen du etiketa lodiak "
"erabiliz. Etiketa hauek iturburutik transferitu daitezke Alt+Eskuina eta "
"Alt+Behera erabiliz. Utzi <b> eta </b> itzulpenean \"now\" hitzari dagokion "
"zatiaren inguruan. XML markaketari buruzko argibide gehiago hemen: http://"
"eu.wikipedia.org/wiki/XML"

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message is very similar to the previous message. Use the suggestion of "
"the previous translation with Ctrl+1. Note how the only difference is that "
"this one ends with a full stop after the last tag."
msgstr ""
"Mezu hau aurrekoaren oso antzekoa da. Erabili aurreko itzulpenaren gomendioa "
"Ktrl+1 bidez. Konturatu nola desberdintasun bakarra azken etiketaren "
"ondorengo amaierako puntua dela."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"In this message \"%d\" is a placeholder (variable) that represents a number. "
"Make sure your translation contains \"%d\" somewhere. In this case it refers "
"a number of files. When this message is used the \"%d\" will be replaced "
"with a number e.g. 'Number of files copied: 5'.  Note that \"%d\" does not "
"refer to a percentage."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honetan \"%d\" leku-marka bat da (aldagaia) eta zenbaki bat adierazten "
"du. Ziurtatu zure itzulpenak \"%d\" erabiltzen duela. Kasu honetan, "
"fitxategien kopuruari egiten dio erreferentzia. Mezu hau erabiltzen denean, "
"\"%d\" zenbaki batekin ordezkatuko da, adib. 'Kopiatutako fitxategien "
"kopurua: 5'. Konturatu \"%d\" leku-markak ez duela inongo portzentaiaren "
"erreferentziarik egiten."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"In this message, \"%d\" refers again to the number of files, but note how "
"the \"(s)\" is used to show that we don't know how many it will be. This is "
"often hard to translate well. If you encounter this in software translation, "
"you might want to hear from developers if this can be avoided. Read more "
"about this and decide how to do it in your language: http://"
"docs.translatehouse.org/projects/localization-guide/en/latest/guide/"
"translation/plurals.html"
msgstr ""
"Mezu honetan, \"%d\" leku-markak fitxategien kopuruari egiten dio "
"erreferentzia berriz ere, baina konturatu nola \"(s)\" erabiltzen den "
"adierazteko ez dakigula zehazki kopurua zein izango den. Askotan itzultzeko "
"zaila da hau. Software-itzulpenetan hau aurkitzen baduzu, garatzaileei galde "
"diezaiekezu ea hau sahies daitekeen. Honi buruzko argibide gehiago dituzu "
"helbide honetan: http://docs.translatehouse.org/projects/localization-guide/"
"en/latest/guide/translation/plurals.html"

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"In this message the proper way of translating plurals are seen. You need to "
"enter between 1 and 6 different versions of the translation to ensure the "
"correct grammar in your language. Read more about this here: http://"
"docs.translatehouse.org/projects/localization-guide/en/latest/guide/"
"translation/plurals.html"
msgstr ""
"Mezu honetan pluralak itzultzeko modu egokia ikusten da. Itzulpenaren "
"bertsio desberdinak idatzi behar dituzu (1 eta 6 artean), zure hizkuntzaren "
"gramatika egokia ziurtatzeko. Honi buruzko argibide gehiago dituzu hemen: "
"http://docs.translatehouse.org/projects/localization-guide/en/latest/guide/"
"translation/plurals.html"

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"In this message, \"%s\" is a placeholder (variable) that represents a file "
"name. Make sure your translation contains %s somewhere. When this message is "
"used, the %s will be replaced with a file name e.g. 'The file will be saved "
"as example.odt'.  Note that \"%s\" does not refer to a percentage."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honetan, \"%s\" leku-marka bat da (aldagaia) eta fitxategi-izena "
"adierazten du. Ziurtatu zure itzulpenak %s duela nonbait. Mezu hau "
"erabiltzen denean, %s fitxategi-izen batekin ordezkatuko da, adib. "
"'Fitxategia adibidea.odt gisa gordeko da'. Konturatu \"%s\" leku-markak ez "
"duela inongo portzentaiaren erreferentziarik egiten."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"In this message the variable is surrounded by double quotes. Make sure your "
"translation contains the variable %s and surround it similarly with quotes "
"in the way required by your language. If your language uses the same quotes "
"as English, type it exactly as shown for the English. If your language uses "
"different quoting characters you can just type them around the variable."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honetan aldagaia kakotxen artean dago. Ziurtatu zure itzulpenak %s "
"aldagaia duela eta zure hizkuntzan egokiak diren aipu-markak erabiltzen "
"dituzula. Zure hizkuntzak ingelesak bezalako kakotxak badarabiltza, kopiatu "
"jatorrizkoan dagoen bezala. Zure hizkuntzak bestelako kakotxak badarabiltza, "
"aldagaiaren inguruan idatz ditzakezu."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"In this message, \"%(name)s\" is a placeholder (variable). Note that the 's' "
"is part of the variable, and the whole variable from '%' to the 's' should "
"appear unchanged somewhere in your translation. These type of variables give "
"you an idea of what they will contain. In this case, it will contain a name."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honetan, \"%(name)s\" leku-marka bat da (aldagaia). Konturatu 's' "
"aldagaiaren zati dela eta '%'tik 's'ra doan aldagai guztiak bere horretan "
"agertu behar duela zure itzulpenean. Aldagai mota hauek edukiari buruzko "
"ideia bat egiten laguntzen dizute. Kasu honetan, izen bat izango du."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"In this message the user of the software is asked to do something. Make sure "
"you translate it by being as polite or respectful as is necessary for your "
"culture."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honetan softwarearen erabiltzaileari zerbait egiteko eskatu zaio. "
"Ziurtatu zure hizkuntzarentzat beharrezkoa den modu zuzen eta adeitsuan "
"itzultzen duzula."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"In this message there is reference to \"Linux\" (a product name). Many "
"languages will not translate it, but your language might use a "
"transliteration if you don't use the Latin script for your language."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honetan \"Linux\" hitzaren erreferentzia dago (produktu-izen bat). "
"Hizkuntza askok ez dute itzuliko, baina baliteke transliterazioa behar "
"izatea zure hizkuntzak ez badu idazkera latina erabiltzen."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message contains the URL (web address) of the project website. It must "
"be transferred as a placeable or typed over exactly."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek proiektuaren webgunearen URLa du (web helbidea). Elementu berezi "
"gisa transferitu behar da edo bere horretan kopiatu."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message refers to a website with more information. Sometimes you might "
"be allowed or encouraged to change the URL (web address) to a website in "
"your language. In this case, replace the \"en\" at the start of the address "
"to your language code so that the address points to the corresponding "
"article in your language about XML."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek informazio gehiago duen webgune bati egiten dio erreferentzia. "
"Batzuetan URLa (web helbidea) aldatzeko gonbita edo baimena izan dezakezu. "
"Kasu honetan, ordezkatu helbidearen hasierako \"en\" hori zure hizkuntzaren "
"kodearekin, horrela helbideak zure hizkuntzan idatzitako XMLi buruzko "
"artikuluari erreferentzia egin diezaion."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This translation contains an ambiguous word - it has two possible meanings. "
"Make sure you can see the context information showing that this is a verb "
"(an action as in \"click here to view it\")."
msgstr ""
"Itzulpen honek hitz anbiguo bat du — bi esanahi posible ditu. Ziurtatu "
"testuinguruaren informazioa ikus dezakezula hau aditz bat dela jakiteko "
"(ekintza bat, adibidez \"egin klik hemen ikusteko\")."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This translation contains an ambiguous word - it has two possible meanings. "
"Make sure you can see the context information showing that this is a noun (a "
"thing as in \"click to change the view to full screen\"). If Virtaal gives "
"your previous translation as a suggestion, take care to only use it if it is "
"definitely appropriate in this case as well."
msgstr ""
"Itzulpen honek hitz anbiguo bat du — bi esanahi posible ditu. Ziurtatu "
"testuinguruaren informazioa ikus dezakezula hau izen bat dela jakiteko "
"(gauza bat, adibidez \"egin klik ikuspegia pantaila osora aldatzeko\"). "
"Virtaal-ek aurreko itzulpena gomendatuko balu, kontuz ibili eta erabili "
"soilik benetan egokia bada."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"An accelerator key is a key on your keyboard that you can press to quickly "
"access a menu or function. It is also called a hot key, access key or "
"mnemonic. In program interfaces they are shown as an underlined letter in "
"the text label. In the translatable text they are marked using some "
"character like the underscore here, but other characters are used for this "
"as well. In this case the accelerator key is \"f\" since the underscore is "
"before this letter and it means that this accelerator could be triggered by "
"pressing Alt+F."
msgstr ""
"Laster-teklak zure teklatuko tekla bat da, menu edo funtzio zehatz baterako "
"sarbidea modu azkarrean izateko saka dezakezuna. Bizkortzaile edo "
"mnemotekniko gisa ere ezagutzen da. Programen interfazeetan azpimarradun "
"karaktere bidez adierazten dira testuan. Itzultzeko testuetan karaktere "
"baten bidez markatzen dira, adibidez hemen bezala azpimarrarekin, baina "
"beste karaktere batzuk ere erabil litezke. Kasu honetan laster-tekla \"f\" "
"da, azpimarra letra honen aurretik dagoelako eta esan nahi du Alt+F sakatuta "
"abiaraz daitekeela bizkortzailea."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid "In this entry you can see other kind of accelerator."
msgstr "Sarrera honetan beste era baterako laster-tekla ikus dezakezu."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid "And another kind of accelerator."
msgstr "Eta beste era baterako beste laster-tekla bat."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"You can maintain a local terminology file to help you translate "
"consistently. To add a term, select a word (or words), press Ctrl+T and fill "
"in the details for the new term. Select the text below and add a term for it."
msgstr ""
"Terminologia-fitxategi lokala manten dezakezu modu kontsistentean itzultzen "
"lagun zaitzan. Termino bat gehitzeko, hautatu hitz edo hitzak, sakatu Ktrl+T "
"eta bete termino berriaren xehetasunak. Hautatu azpiko testua eta gehitu "
"termino bat."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"In the previous entry you have created one terminology entry for the "
"\"filter\" verb. Now do the same for \"filter\" noun."
msgstr ""
"Aurreko sarreran \"filter\" aditzarentzako terminologia-sarrera bat sortu "
"duzu. Orain egizu berdina \"filter\" izenarentzat."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"If you have created any terminology in the previous entries you may now see "
"some of the words with a green background (or other color depending on your "
"theme). This means that Virtaal has terminology suggestions for that word. "
"Use Alt+Right to select the highlighted word, and then press Alt+Down. If "
"only one suggestion is provided then Alt+Down just copies the suggestion to "
"the translation field. But if several suggestions are available Alt+Down "
"shows a suggestion list which you can navigate using Down and Up keys. Once "
"you have selected the desired suggestion press Enter to copy it to the "
"translation field."
msgstr ""
"Aurreko sarreretan terminologiarik sortu baduzu, hitzetako batzuk atzeko "
"plano berdearekin ikusiko dituzu (edo beste kolore batean, zure itxuraren "
"arabera). Honek esan nahi du Virtaal-ek hitz horrentzat terminologia-"
"gomendioak dituela. Erabili Alt+Eskuina nabarmendutako hitza hautatzeko eta "
"gero sakatu Alt+Behera. Gomendio bakarra balego, orduan Alt+Behera "
"konbinazioak gomendioa itzulpen-eremuan kopiatzen du. Baina hainbat gomendio "
"baleude, Alt+Behera sakatzean zerrenda bat erakutsiko da, Behera eta Gora "
"teklekin nabiga daitekeena. Behin nahi duzun gomendioa hautatuta, sakatu "
"Enter itzulpen-eremuan kopiatzeko."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message has two lines. Make sure that your translation also contains "
"two lines. You can separate lines with Shift+Enter or copy newline "
"placeables (displayed as ¶)."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek bi lerro ditu. Ziurtatu zure itzulpenak ere bi lerro dituela. "
"Lerroak Shift+Enter bidez banatu edo lerro berriaren elementu bereziak kopia "
"ditzakezu (¶ gisa bistaratzen dira)."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message contains tab characters to separate some headings. Make sure "
"you separate your translations in the same way."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek goiburuak bereizteko tabulazio-karaktereak ditu. Ziurtatu zure "
"itzulpenean modu berean bereizten dituzula."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message contains a large number that is formatted according to the "
"American convention. Translate this but make sure to format the number "
"according to your language's convention. You might need to change the comma "
"(,) and full stop (.) to other characters, and you also might need to use a "
"different number system. Make sure that you understand the American "
"formatting: this number is bigger than one thousand."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek AEBtako arauen arabera formateatutako zenbaki handi bat du. Itzul "
"ezazu baina ziurtatu zenbakia zure hizkuntzaren arauen arabera idazten "
"duzula. Litekeena da koma (,) eta puntua (.) beste karaktere batzuekin "
"ordezkatu behar izatea, eta beharbada bestelako zenbaki-sistema bat erabili "
"beharko duzu. Ziurtatu AEBtako formatua ulertzen duzula: zenbaki hau mila "
"baino handiagoa da."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message refers to miles. If the programmers encourage it, you might "
"want to change this to kilometres in your translation, if kilometers are "
"more commonly used in your language. Note that 1 mile is about 1.6 "
"kilometres. Note that automated tests for \"numbers\" will complain if the "
"number is changed, but in this case it is safe to do so."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek miliei egiten die erreferentzia. Programatzaileek hala iradokiko "
"balute, kilometrotara alda dezakezu zure itzulpenean, kilometroak erabiltzen "
"badira zure hizkuntzan noski. Konturatu milia bat 1,6 kilometro direla gutxi "
"gorabehera. Konturatu halaber zenbakietarako egiaztapen automatikoak huts "
"egingo duela zenbakia aldatzen bada, baina kasu honetan segurua da hau "
"egitea."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message contains a link that the user will be able to click on to visit "
"the help page. Make sure you correctly keep the information between the "
"angle brackets (<...>). The double quotes (\") should never be changed in "
"tags, even if your language uses a different type of quotation marks."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek laguntza-orria bisitatzeko erabiltzaileak klik egin dezakeen "
"esteka bat du. Ziurtatu angeludun parentesien (<...>) arteko informazioa "
"zuzen mantentzen duzula. Kakotx bikoitzak (\") ez dira inoiz aldatu behar "
"etiketetan, nahiz eta zure hizkuntzak bestelako aipu-markak erabili."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This message contains a similar link, but the programmers decided to rather "
"insert the tags by using variables so that translators can't change them. "
"Make sure you position the two variables (%s) so that they correspond to the "
"opening and closing tags of the previous translation."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek antzerako esteka bat du, baina programatzaileek erabaki dute "
"etiketen ordez aldagaiak erabiltzea, itzultzaileek hauek aldatzea ekiditeko. "
"Ziurtatu bi aldagaiak (%s) aurreko itzulpenari dagozkien irekitze- eta ixte-"
"etiketen kokalekuan jartzen dituzula."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message contains the <b> and </b> tags to emphasize a word, while "
"everything is within the <p> and </p> tags. Make sure your whole translation "
"is within the <p> and </p> tags."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek <b> eta </b> etiketak ditu hitz bat nabarmentzeko, eta "
"gainontzekoa <p> eta </p> etiketen artean dago. Ziurtatu zure itzulpen osoa "
"<p> eta </p> etiketen artean dagoela."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
msgid ""
"This message contains a similar link that is contained within <span> and </"
"span>. Make sure you correctly keep all the tags (<...>), and that the link "
"is completely contained within the <span> and </span> tags in your "
"translation. Make sure that the text inside the \"a\" tags correspond to "
"\"help page\" and that your translation corresponding to the second sentence "
"is contained in the <span> tags. Note how the full stop is still inside the "
"</span> tag."
msgstr ""
"Mezu honek <span> eta </span> artean antzeko esteka bat du. Ziurtatu etiketa "
"guztiak (<...>) zuzen mantentzen dituzula eta esteka <span> eta </span> "
"etiketen artean dagoela itzulpenean. Ziurtatu \"a\" etiketen barruko testuak "
"\"help page\"-i dagokiola eta bigarren esaldiari dagokion zure itzulpena "
"<span> etiketen artean doala. Konturatu nola bukaerako puntua </span> "
"etiketaren barruan dagoen."

